B.ND=new A.e3("core_conquest",B.ku,"Karo Ke\u015ffi & Fetih (Sis A\xe7ma)","Hex Conquest & Fog of War","Kom\u015fu karolara yay\u0131larak s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 geni\u015fletin. Fetih maliyeti fethedilen toplam karo say\u0131s\u0131na g\xf6re artar.","Expand territory by conquering adjacent tiles. Cost scales with total owned tile count.",'Haritada sahip olunan arazilerin s\u0131n\u0131r kom\u015fular\u0131 "Ke\u015ffedildi" (Discovered) durumuna ge\xe7er. Sis kalkt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda karonun biyom t\xfcr\xfc g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr. Fethetti\u011finiz her yeni karo i\xe7in gereken G\u0131da maliyeti kademeli olarak artar (Temel: 5 G\u0131da * 1.35^karo).',"Adjacent hexes to owned land become discovered. Conquering tiles costs Food, scaling exponentially with each conquered tile.",B.O5,B.a8,"FET\u0130H & S\u0130S",B.UP,B.SA,B.SN,B.QD,B.Sk,B.QU)
