B.Th=s(["Her biyomun kendine has binalar\u0131 vard\u0131r; \xf6rne\u011fin Vaha Sarn\u0131c\u0131 yaln\u0131zca \xc7\xf6l karolar\u0131na kurulabilir."],t.s)
