B.NI=new A.e3("biome_varieties",B.kv,"11 Bozk\u0131r Biyomu & Do\u011fal Zenginlikler","11 Steppe Biomes & Natural Yields","\xc7ay\u0131rdan Altay Tundras\u0131na, Yanarda\u011fdan Kristal Yar\u0131\u011f\u0131na kadar 11 farkl\u0131 co\u011frafi arazi tipi.","From Meadows to Altay Tundra, Volcanoes to Crystal Chasms: 11 distinct biomes.","HexRush arazisi 11 farkl\u0131 biyomdan olu\u015fur:\n1. \xc7ay\u0131r (Meadow): Bu\u011fday, arpa, mera ve at s\xfcr\xfcleri.\n2. Orman (Forest): Kereste, hu\u015f katran\u0131 ve re\xe7ine.\n3. Da\u011f (Mountain): Ta\u015f k\xfctleleri ve demir filizleri.\n4. Deniz / G\xf6l (Sea): Bal\u0131k\xe7\u0131l\u0131k ve su k\xf6pr\xfcs\xfc.\n5. Karakum \xc7\xf6l\xfc (Desert): Vaha sarn\u0131c\u0131, kervansaray ve rasathane.\n6. Altay Tundras\u0131 (Tundra): Geyik ota\u011f\u0131 ve jeotermal kapl\u0131ca.\n7. Yanarda\u011f (Volcano): Obsidyen oca\u011f\u0131 ve buhar menfezi.\n8. Bozk\u0131r Sazl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Wetland): \u015eifac\u0131 ota\u011f\u0131, par\u015f\xf6men ve sazl\u0131k.\n9. G\xf6ksel Krater (Celestial Crater): G\xf6ksel \xf6rs ve meteorik maden.\n10. Atalar Kurgan\u0131 (Kurgan Valley): Ata miras\u0131 balballar\u0131 ve totemler.\n11. Kristal Yar\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Crystal Chasm): Kristal rezonat\xf6r ve prizmatik rezonans.","Features 11 biomes: Meadow, Forest, Mountain, Sea, Desert, Tundra, Volcano, Wetland, Celestial Crater, Kurgan Valley, and Crystal Chasm, each with unique buildings and yields.",B.tL,B.M,"11 CO\u011eRAFYA",B.UU,B.bm,B.bm,B.Th,B.SZ,B.Rq)
